# One word per line. Optionally add "|your own example sentence" after the word.
# If you don't provide an example, the script looks one up automatically via the free
# Dictionary API (https://api.dictionaryapi.dev) - if none is found there, the word is still
# added (with an empty example you can fill in later from the Firebase console).
#
# Copy this file to new_words.txt (same folder) and edit it, then run:
#   .\add_words.ps1
#
Ambitious|She has always been ambitious about her career.
Diligent
Meticulous|He is meticulous about checking every detail before submitting his work.
